{"meta":{"ui":"checkout","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","designSystem":"cards","turn":"retry","prompt":"Build a small checkout in three steps: my cart (three items with quantities), a shipping form (name, address, city, postcode, email, all checked, with messages under the fields), then a payment summary with a choice of standard or express delivery changing the total, and a confirmation screen with an order number. I can go back a step without losing what I typed.","text":"The Input keyboard value must be one of the allowed names. For email I'll use the notation's own `type:email` form, which the notation maps to the right keyboard.\n\nAlso, the earlier version used `string(...)`, `random()` and an unsupported `Button.outline` style chain that isn't needed here, and it kept order numbers unstable. Below, the order number is fixed when the order is placed, and the email field uses `type:email`.\n\nstate step=1\nstate cart=[{\"id\":1,\"name\":\"Espresso beans, 1 kg\",\"price\":24,\"qty\":1},{\"id\":2,\"name\":\"Ceramic pour-over set\",\"price\":38,\"qty\":1},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Paper filters (100)\",\"price\":6,\"qty\":2}]\nstate name=\"\"\nstate address=\"\"\nstate city=\"\"\nstate postcode=\"\"\nstate email=\"\"\nstate delivery=\"standard\"\nstate orderNo=\"\"\nColumn gap:12 pad:16 w:390\n  Row between middle\n    Text.pageTitle \"Checkout\"\n    Badge.neutral \"Step {step} of 3\"\n  if step==1\n    Card gap:10\n      Text.sectionTitle \"My cart\"\n      each row in cart\n        Row between middle\n          Text.body \"{row.name} x {row.qty}\"\n          Text.strong \"{money(row.price*row.qty,\\\"$\\\",2)}\"\n      Divider\n      Row between\n        Text.strong \"Subtotal\"\n        Text.strong \"{money(sum(cart,i=>i.price*i.qty),\\\"$\\\",2)}\"\n      Button \"Continue to shipping\" -> step=2\n  if step==2\n    Card gap:10\n      Text.sectionTitle \"Shipping\"\n      Input \"Full name\" =name\n      if length(trim(name))==0\n        Text.danger \"Name is required.\"\n      Input \"Address\" =address\n      if length(trim(address))==0\n        Text.danger \"Address is required.\"\n      Input \"City\" =city\n      if length(trim(city))==0\n        Text.danger \"City is required.\"\n      Input \"Postcode\" =postcode\n      if length(trim(postcode))<4\n        Text.danger \"Enter a valid postcode.\"\n      Input \"Email\" type:email =email\n      if !contains(email,\"@\")\n        Text.danger \"Enter a valid email.\"\n      Row gap:8\n        Button.outline \"Back\" -> step=1\n        Spacer grow\n        Button \"Continue to payment\" -> step=3\n  if step==3\n    Card gap:10\n      Text.sectionTitle \"Payment summary\"\n      Text.body \"Shipping to {name}, {address}, {city} {postcode}\"\n      Text.strong \"Delivery\"\n      Row gap:8\n        ChoiceChip \"Standard ($4)\" selected:=delivery==\"standard\" -> delivery=\"standard\"\n        ChoiceChip \"Express ($12)\" selected:=delivery==\"express\" -> delivery=\"express\"\n      Divider\n      Row between\n        Text.body \"Items\"\n        Text.body \"{money(sum(cart,i=>i.price*i.qty),\\\"$\\\",2)}\"\n      Row between\n        Text.body \"Shipping\"\n        Text.body \"{money(delivery==\\\"express\\\"?12:4,\\\"$\\\",2)}\"\n      Row between\n        Text.heading \"Total\"\n        Text.heading \"{money(sum(cart,i=>i.price*i.qty)+(delivery==\\\"express\\\"?12:4),\\\"$\\\",2)}\"\n      Row gap:8\n        Button.outline \"Back\" -> step=2\n        Spacer grow\n        Button \"Place order\" -> orderNo=\"KX-\"+round(sum(cart,i=>i.id)*7919+length(name)*31+12345,0); step=4\n  if step==4\n    Card gap:10 pad:20\n      Badge.success \"Confirmed\"\n      Text.pageTitle \"Thank you, {name}\"\n      Text.body \"Your order is placed. A receipt is on its way to {email}.\"\n      Text.strong \"Order number {orderNo}\"\n      Button \"Back to cart\" -> step=1","usage":{"input_tokens":9112,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"e